[node name="Text" type="Label" parent="HUD/Root/HelpPanel/Margin"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.858824, 0.827451, 0.788235, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.784314)
theme_override_constants/line_spacing = 2
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 4
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 13
text = "VOXELBOUND

WASD      move (relative to the camera)
Space     jump  (auto-steps single blocks)
Shift     sprint (burns energy)

Q / E     rotate the world 90 degrees
Wheel     zoom

LMB       mine (hold)
RMB       place selected block
F         swing at critters
1-9       select hotbar slot

C         toggle the cutaway system
R         respawn
F1        close this panel
Esc       quit

The camera never gets blocked: anything
between the lens and you is sliced away
along your own depth plane, and the
exposed cross-section is rebuilt as
real geometry. Dig in, or walk into a
house, and watch."

